  "idea": "AI client contract reviewer that highlights red flags",
  "text": "The biggest mistake freelancers make is ignoring indemnification clauses\u2014fix it with this. Signing client agreements without reviewing indemnity language means you personally absorb third-party lawsuits and catastrophic legal fees. Standard corporate contracts routinely force outside contractors to cover client damages without any reasonable monetary cap. Run the agreement through Contract-GPT to flag uncapped indemnity and replace it with mutual liability protection. You safeguard your business from devastating litigation with zero legal fees.",
